[{"current_page":9,"data":[{"id":278,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_type":"Static Image","title":"Exactly","publisher":null,"authors":"Exactly","featuring":null,"publish_date":"2023-09-01","link":"https:\/\/exactly.ai\/","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: normal;\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Generative tool for 'training' a unique model based on your own style. Both the model and the outputs subsequently belong to the artist. The tool accepts up to 25 images, pressumably for fine-tuning a larger model, though Exactly do not specifiy. They provide considerable basis to their conception of ownership for artists, though there is little accompanying research to assess what training data or foundation model was used in the first instance. This could be a very useful tool for artists looking to expand on and experiment with their existing style. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:771,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}\">Generative tool for 'training' a unique model based on your own style. Both the model and the outputs subsequently belong to the artist. The tool accepts up to 25 images, pressumably for fine-tuning a larger model, though Exactly do not specifiy. They provide considerable basis to their conception of ownership for artists, though there is little accompanying research to assess what training data or foundation model was used in the first instance. This could be a very useful tool for artists looking to expand on and experiment with their existing style. <\/span><\/p>","contact":null,"permission_status":null,"license":null,"example":null,"source":null,"editors":null,"image":null,"is_visible":1,"created_at":"2023-11-15T12:07:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-11-15T12:08:43.000000Z","pinned":0},{"id":277,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_type":"Text","title":"Perplexity Co-Pilot","publisher":null,"authors":"Perplexity","featuring":null,"publish_date":"2023-09-01","link":"https:\/\/www.perplexity.ai\/","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: normal;\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Proprietary chat-based 'co-pilot' combining GPT-4 and Claude, aiming for factual accuracy with web search functionality. It provides citations for it's claims to instill trustworthiness, though these require assessment by the user each time. They do not publish accompanying research for public scrutiny, so the overall infrastructure remains opaque, though each instance of use can be scrutinised by users, allowing for front-end, aggregated review. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:771,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}\">Proprietary chat-based 'co-pilot' combining GPT-4 and Claude, aiming for factual accuracy with web search functionality. It provides citations for it's claims to instill trustworthiness, though these require assessment by the user each time. They do not publish accompanying research for public scrutiny, so the overall infrastructure remains opaque, though each instance of use can be scrutinised by users, allowing for front-end, aggregated review. <\/span><\/p>","contact":null,"permission_status":null,"license":null,"example":null,"source":null,"editors":null,"image":null,"is_visible":1,"created_at":"2023-11-15T12:06:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-11-15T12:07:42.000000Z","pinned":0},{"id":276,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_type":"Audio","title":"Semilla","publisher":null,"authors":"herorcismos","featuring":null,"publish_date":"2023-10-01","link":"https:\/\/twitter.com\/semilla_ai?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: normal;\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;A generative music tool for Max 8. Described by the developers as 'an interface for uncovering and exploring the &ldquo;latent space&rdquo; or multidimensional space within a generative neural network for audio synthesis' exploring the 'techno-poetics of Mixe divination through &ldquo;maiz throwing&rdquo;'. The models are built on the open-source 'RAVE' architecture, and can be downloaded for free, experimented with in Max, and subsequently interfaced with other DAWs. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:1049347,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;23&quot;:1}\">A generative music tool for Max 8. Described by the developers as 'an interface for uncovering and exploring the &ldquo;latent space&rdquo; or multidimensional space within a generative neural network for audio synthesis' exploring the 'techno-poetics of Mixe divination through &ldquo;maiz throwing&rdquo;'. The models are built on the open-source 'RAVE' architecture, and can be downloaded for free, experimented with in Max, and subsequently interfaced with other DAWs. <\/span><\/p>","contact":null,"permission_status":null,"license":null,"example":null,"source":null,"editors":null,"image":null,"is_visible":1,"created_at":"2023-11-15T12:04:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-11-15T12:06:10.000000Z","pinned":1},{"id":275,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_type":"Gaming","title":"MindMaker","publisher":null,"authors":"Unreal Engine","featuring":null,"publish_date":"2023-10-05","link":"https:\/\/www.unrealengine.com\/marketplace\/en-US\/product\/mindmaker-ai-plugin","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: normal;\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;The MindMaker AI Plugin, according to Unreal Engine, is an open-source plugin that enables games and simulations within Unreal Engine 4 and 5 to function as environments for training autonomous machine learning agents. The plugin facilitates a network connection between an Unreal Project containing the learning environment, and a standalone machine learning library. UE provide a Discord community to accompany the tool's launch, and broad algorithm integrations for interoperability. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:769,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}\">The MindMaker AI Plugin, according to Unreal Engine, is an open-source plugin that enables games and simulations within Unreal Engine 4 and 5 to function as environments for training autonomous machine learning agents. The plugin facilitates a network connection between an Unreal Project containing the learning environment, and a standalone machine learning library. UE provide a Discord community to accompany the tool's launch, and broad algorithm integrations for interoperability. <\/span><\/p>","contact":null,"permission_status":null,"license":null,"example":null,"source":null,"editors":null,"image":null,"is_visible":1,"created_at":"2023-10-02T10:22:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-10-02T10:24:09.000000Z","pinned":1},{"id":274,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_type":"Gaming","title":"MineRL","publisher":null,"authors":"William H Guss, Brandon Houghton, Nicholay Topin, Phillip Wang, Cayden Codel, Manuela Veloso, Ruslan Salakhutdinov","featuring":null,"publish_date":"2019-01-02","link":"https:\/\/minerl.io\/","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: normal;\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Imitation learning dataset with over 60 million frames of recorded human player data, compiled to train agents that play Minecraft. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:769,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}\">Imitation learning dataset with over 60 million frames of recorded human player data, compiled to train agents that play Minecraft. <\/span><\/p>","contact":null,"permission_status":null,"license":null,"example":nu